# TOGAF ADM F: Migration Planning — Meridian Global Carrier case study (2026 cloud
# modernization of the Unification-operating-model carrier from Enterprise
# Architecture as Strategy). One domain FRAGMENT of the shared
# meridian-adm-cycle domain: this phase's 3 actions chain
# opportunities-produced -> phase-f-step1-done -> phase-f-step2-done -> migration-plan-produced,
# so the merged cycle plan can only reach this phase after its predecessor
# completes. 8-constraint split: every precondition/effect/goal here is a
# 1-conjunct (and ...) — far inside PDDL8_MAX_CONJUNCTS=8 — and each action
# takes 1 parameter (PDDL8_MAX_PARAMS=8); togaf_test.rs asserts these bounds
# mechanically for every fragment.
#
# Public-ontology doctrine: the artifact node is a blank node; the phase is
# identified by its public SKOS notation. The only private predicates are
# the cng pipeline's ABI carrier ceng:pddlDomain (urn:chatman:engine#),
# disclosed in packs/togaf-adm-pack/ontology.ttl.
@prefix ceng:    <urn:chatman:engine#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

_:artifact
    skos:notation "ADM-PHASE-F" ;
    dcterms:description "F: Migration Planning domain fragment of the meridian-adm-cycle STRIPS domain."@en ;
    ceng:pddlDomain """
(define (domain meridian-adm-cycle)
  (:requirements :strips)
  (:predicates
    (opportunities-produced ?x)
    (phase-f-step1-done ?x)
    (phase-f-step2-done ?x)
    (migration-plan-produced ?x))
  (:action sequence-work-packages
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (opportunities-produced ?x))
    :effect (and (phase-f-step1-done ?x)))
  (:action align-finops-budget
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (phase-f-step1-done ?x))
    :effect (and (phase-f-step2-done ?x)))
  (:action produce-migration-plan
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (phase-f-step2-done ?x))
    :effect (and (migration-plan-produced ?x))))
""" .
